VTID-03818 — commands.log
==========================

## Confirm the live bugs before touching anything

$ mcp__Supabase__execute_sql
  select status, spec_status, is_terminal, count(*) from vtid_ledger group by 1,2,3 order by 4 desc;
-> confirmed: 47 rows status='complete' (distinct from 'completed'); a long
   tail of status/spec_status/is_terminal combinations including
   status='deleted' with is_terminal not true.

$ mcp__Supabase__execute_sql
  select count(*), min(created_at), max(created_at) from vtid_ledger
  where title = 'Allocated - Pending Title';
-> 703 rows, spanning 2025-12-19 to 2026-09-10.

$ mcp__Supabase__execute_sql
  select is_terminal, count(*) from vtid_ledger where title='Allocated - Pending Title' group by 1;
-> is_terminal=false: 184, is_terminal=true: 519.

## Root-cause read (source, not assumption)

Read services/gateway/src/routes/vtid.ts deriveAllocationTitle() (line 40):
returns null whenever source is unset/'api' -- and source defaults to 'api'
on line 86 whenever a caller doesn't pass one. /allocate-internal (line 199)
has NO title logic at all -- confirmed by reading the whole handler.

Read services/gateway/src/services/dev-autopilot-execute.ts
allocatedOrphanReaperTick() (line 3117): PATCH body sets status='deleted'
but never is_terminal/terminal_outcome (line 3133-3141 before fix).

Read services/gateway/src/routes/oasis-tasks.ts's manual delete endpoint
(line 447-462): sets is_terminal:true, terminal_outcome:'deleted' alongside
status:'deleted' -- confirms the reaper was the one write site NOT matching
this pattern (repo-wide grep for every "status: 'deleted'"/"status=deleted"
write site turns up exactly these two).

Read services/gateway/src/frontend/command-hub/app.js: mapStatusToColumn()
(line 10965), renderTaskDrawer()'s isFinalMode (line 8210),
isInconsistentState (line 8233), isCompleted (line 9556) -- confirmed all
four check taskStatus === 'completed' only, never 'complete'.

## Fix

- vtid.ts: deriveAllocationTitle() rewritten to always return a real string
  (module+vtid fallback instead of null); both /allocate and
  /allocate-internal call sites updated to always PATCH the derived title.
- dev-autopilot-execute.ts: allocatedOrphanReaperTick()'s PATCH body now
  includes is_terminal:true, terminal_outcome:'deleted', deleted_at,
  deleted_by -- matching oasis-tasks.ts's manual-delete pattern.
- app.js: 'complete' added alongside 'completed' in all four checks.

## One-time live data migration

$ mcp__Supabase__apply_migration name=vtid_03818_ledger_hygiene_normalize_status_and_backfill_terminal
  UPDATE vtid_ledger SET status='completed' WHERE status='complete';
  UPDATE vtid_ledger SET is_terminal=true, terminal_outcome=COALESCE(terminal_outcome,'deleted')
    WHERE status='deleted' AND is_terminal IS DISTINCT FROM true;
-> {"success": true}

$ mcp__Supabase__execute_sql (verify)
  select (select count(*) from vtid_ledger where status='complete') as a,
         (select count(*) from vtid_ledger where status='deleted' and is_terminal is distinct from true) as b;
-> {"a": 0, "b": 0}

See outputs/live-verification.txt for the full before/after transcript.

